{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\Flashcards\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/DeckService.php:50 new DateTime()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 1 place. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Service/DeckService.php:50 new DateTime()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocs-unreferenced",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "POST /ocs/v2.php/apps/flashcards/api/v1/decks  ocs.flashcards.deck.create  lib/Controller/DeckController.php:24",
        "GET /ocs/v2.php/apps/flashcards/api/v1/decks  ocs.flashcards.deck.show  lib/Controller/DeckController.php:39"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "Nothing in the app calls 2 OCS routes. OCS is there for clients outside the app, so this is no defect in itself.",
        "  POST /ocs/v2.php/apps/flashcards/api/v1/decks  ocs.flashcards.deck.create  lib/Controller/DeckController.php:24",
        "  GET /ocs/v2.php/apps/flashcards/api/v1/decks  ocs.flashcards.deck.show  lib/Controller/DeckController.php:39"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "openapi-missing",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app has 2 OCS routes and no openapi.json. Clients of OCS are generated from such a specification, and nothing else tells them what these routes take and return."
      ]
    }
  ],
